{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-09-15 16:10:00', 'title': "KROGER'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND", 'text': "CINCINNATI, OHIO , SEPT. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO.'S (NYSE: KR) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 26 CENTS PER SHARE TO BE PAID ON DECEMBER 1, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 15, 2022."}{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-09-15 09:10:00', 'title': 'KROGER EXPANDS PERSONALIZED FINANCIAL COUNSELING SERVICES TO MORE ASSOCIATES', 'text': 'SERVICE PROVIDES FREE, CONFIDENTIAL FINANCIAL PLANNING CINCINNATI , SEPT. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR) ANNOUNCED TODAY A NEW COLLABORATION THAT PROVIDES FINANCIAL COUNSELING OPPORTUNITIES FOR ITS ASSOCIATES.'}